# Requirement tracker

`docs/requirements/AGENT-REQUIREMENT-IMPLEMENTATION.md` is the only place for implementation status.

- Set the row to `in_progress` **before** coding.
- Set `done` only after skill `verify-gates` is green. Never mark `done` on a red gate.
- If blocked, set `blocked` with the reason in Notes.
- Pick tracker order (file number) unless the user names a module. Exceptions: `29-books-gst` period-lock before `28-stock-take` posts; POS (`21`) waits for §3 stubs.
- One module per run. Never batch rows to `done`.
- Never record status inside numbered requirement markdown files.

